  "notes": "RELATED VERB:\n{痺|しび}れる - to go numb, to feel pins and needles\n\nCOMMON EXPRESSIONS:\n- {痺|しび}れがくる - to go numb\n- {痺|しび}れが{切|き}れる - for numbness to wear off\n- {手足|てあし}の{痺|しび}れ - numbness in the limbs\n\nRELATED PHYSICAL SENSATIONS:\n- むくみ - swelling\n- かゆみ - itchiness\n- {凝|こ}り - stiffness\n\nMEDICAL CONTEXT:\n{痺|しび}れ can be a symptom of various conditions including poor circulation, nerve compression, or neurological issues. See a doctor if persistent.",
